  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;can take values</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>43</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>47</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>47</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>47</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>47</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>47</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>}</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>47</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>47</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>47</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>47</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8801;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>'</mo></msup></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenc